    "detailed_description": "Yarn Guardians is a 2D action-adventure that combines elements of shoot'em up games and the open level structure of Metroidvania games with twin-stick shooter controls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/023f549b7a9b238d9b631ac54284c61d.poster.avif?t=1755187090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/023f549b7a9b238d9b631ac54284c61d.webm?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/023f549b7a9b238d9b631ac54284c61d.mp4?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Rudy and his friends to restore the balance in a fragmented world:</h2>Rudy's peaceful life changes abruptly when his home is wrecked by carrot wielding bunnies. He embarks on a journey unaware that he is following in the footsteps of the legendary Yarn Guardians. On his path, the adventurous cat encounters power-hungry villains, shady characters and new friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/d103eabfad51fbb92e2a4f88cb742210.poster.avif?t=1755187090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/d103eabfad51fbb92e2a4f88cb742210.webm?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/d103eabfad51fbb92e2a4f88cb742210.mp4?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Twin-stick shooter</strong>-like combat controls <br></li><li> Fight with <strong>five unique Yarn Balls</strong> to defeat adorable foes<br></li><li> Meet numerous <strong>hand-animated</strong> protagonists, enemies and NPCs<br></li><li> Fly and fight your way through <strong>colorful hand-drawn environments</strong><br></li><li> Enjoy a<strong> light-hearted, humorous story</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/71e747c93272cf007a496ab9d5044bae.poster.avif?t=1755187090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/71e747c93272cf007a496ab9d5044bae.webm?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/71e747c93272cf007a496ab9d5044bae.mp4?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play the main campaign alone or with a friend<br></li><li>Compete against each other in a four player versus mode</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/69d259047364d8ea524b4b02302f113f.poster.avif?t=1755187090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/69d259047364d8ea524b4b02302f113f.webm?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928940/extras/69d259047364d8ea524b4b02302f113f.mp4?t=1755187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
